  "content": "\n\n<p><span style=\"font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace\">這是 ToroHealth Damage Indicators 的非官方移植版本，支援 Forge 1.20。</span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace\">搭配&nbsp;<strong>ToroHealth</strong>&nbsp;Damage Indicators 使用時，當玩家準星對準特定實體，該實體的生命值條便會顯示於畫面左上角。</span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/303/407/hud.png\" alt=\"HUD\"></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace\">更多詳細資訊，請查看 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/torohealth-damage-indicators\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">原版模組的頁面</a>。</span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace\">若原作者已推出此版本的更新，建議<strong>優先使用原版模組</strong>。</span></p>",
  "contentType": "text/html",
  "type": "curseforge"
}
